{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:10SwiftGodot17AnimationNodeSub2C","roleHeading":"Class","title":"AnimationNodeSub2","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"AnimationNodeSub2","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AnimationNodeSub2","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"SwiftGodot"}]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/AnimationNodeSub2\/godotClassName"],"title":"Type Properties"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"AnimationNodeSub2","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A resource to add to an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/AnimationNodeBlendTree","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Blends two animations subtractively based on the amount value."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This animation node is usually used for pre-calculation to cancel out any extra poses from the animation for the “add” animation source in "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/AnimationNodeAdd2","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/AnimationNodeAdd3","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In general, the blend value should be in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"[0.0, 1.0]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" range, but values outside of this range can be used for amplifie